Support creating dependent tasks using [> <] syntax

On save the text within the delimiters should become the title of a newly
created task, and the body of the current task should be modified with a standard
internal link [[<namepace>-<id>]]. The "depends-on" property should be correctly
set/appended to include the newly created task link (as an internal link) and
the newly created task should have a "blocks" property that has the ID of the
current task's ID as an internal link.